  "description": "Upgrade basic chicken salad with feta, fresh herbs, and a tangy yogurt-mayo dressing that's perfect for sandwiches, wraps, and lettuce cups.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 1 hr 45 min.\n\nNotes: About 4 cups of chopped rotisserie chicken can be used in place of cooking your own chicken, if desired. If using rotisserie chicken, start the recipe at step 5.\nFor variations, try adding 1/2 cup of chopped pepperoncini, cherry peppers, celery, or fresh cucumber.\n\nMake-ahead and storage: The chicken salad can be eaten right away or covered and refrigerated for up to 3 days to let the flavors meld.",
